From 6c209b0121d6deb9f8e4062dc4aae1ed9069fc45 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 10:36:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Schedules on Vercel: /cron/run-schedules for an outside timer
 (cron-job.org)

Vercel pauses the API when the app is not open, so Schedule Triggers never fired.
An outside timer calls GET /cron/run-schedules?key=CRON_SECRET every few minutes;
it starts each due occurrence once (same idempotency key as the in-process timer)
and waits for the runs to finish before answering.

